SDK patch 0318 (Max Payne 3 port): the tonemap's pixel UBO as uploaded (the differential path's shadow) against
the register file, one line per tonemap per 10 s. Every other link of the draw is proven clean (exact container,
clean vertices, correct textures); if the shadow words differ from the registers the differential upload is the
bug, if they match the compiled DKSH variant is - and that one is chased offline.

